flowchart TD
    Open[Player opens existing Getting started] --> Panel[Scene-owned DemoGuidancePanel]
    Session[Current GameSession committed state / replacement] --> Dirty[Mark dirty and queue one deferred visible read]
    Logistics[Current automatic logistics changed] --> Dirty
    Open --> Dirty
    Dirty --> Reader[Read current authoritative facts]
    Reader --> Factory[Reuse FactoryPlan manufacture history]
    Reader --> School[Rear people qualifications and current course rows]
    Reader --> Transport[Live registered trucks, crew readiness, active manifests]
    Reader --> Army[Reuse ArmySupplyView stock, demand and receipt distinctions]
    Reader --> Next[Explain one current preparation action]
    Next --> Navigate[Emit existing navigation String only]
    Navigate --> Controls[Existing Build / Production / Supplies / Training / Vehicles / Army needs]
    Hidden[Hidden or unbound] --> Wait[Keep dirty; no polling or model read]
    Replacement[Replace or bind session] --> Clear[Disconnect old owners; clear stale action]
    Clear --> Dirty
